<title>DENMARK: Oeresundsforbindelsen sets 300 mln DKK 4 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Oeresundsforbindelsen sets 300 mln DKK 4 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced by lead manager Gudme Raaschou Bankaktieselskab on Thursday.</p>
<p>It followed an earlier announcement of a separate four</p>
<p>percent, 350 million crown, eight-year issue.</p>
<p>BORROWER - A/S OERESUNDSFORBINDELSEN</p>
<p>AMT - 300 MLN DANISH CROWNS</p>
<p>COUPON - FOUR PERCENT</p>
<p>MATURITY - SEVEN YEARS</p>
<p>ISS PRICE - TO BE ADVISED</p>
<p>ISS DATE - 20 JANUARY 1997</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
